---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Logo from '../components/Logo.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
const updated = 'October 1, 2026';
---
<Base title={`Privacy Policy | ${site.name}`} description={`How ${site.name} collects and uses your information.`} path="/privacy">
  <header class="container-x py-6"><a href="/" aria-label="Back to home"><Logo /></a></header>
  <main class="container-x max-w-3xl pb-24">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl mt-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Last updated {updated}</p>
    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-body [&_h2]:text-2xl [&_h2]:mt-10 [&_h2]:mb-2">
      <p>This policy explains what information {site.name} (“we”, “us”) collects through this website and how we use it.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you complete our Territory Check, we collect the details you enter: your name, company, email, phone number, website, service area and answers about your business. We also record how you found us (for example, campaign tags in the link you clicked) and basic usage data through analytics and advertising tools such as Google Analytics and the Meta Pixel, if enabled.</p>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use your information to assess whether we’re a good fit, prepare for and schedule your Pipeline Audit, and contact you by phone, text or email about our services. We use analytics data to understand and improve this website and our advertising.</p>
      <h2>Sharing</h2>
      <p>We don’t sell your information. We share it only with service providers that help us run our business (such as our scheduling, email, spreadsheet and analytics tools), and only as needed to provide those services, or when required by law.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can opt out of text messages by replying STOP, and unsubscribe from emails using the link in any email. To access, correct or delete your information, email us at <a class="underline" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>We keep your information for as long as needed for the purposes above, or as required by law.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy? Email <a class="underline" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
